*Why OSHC services book us*

## An easy, inclusive holiday highlight

Every child gets an instrument, so nobody waits on the sidelines. Because no experience is needed, the session also suits mixed ages and abilities.

For example, our Easter vacation care incursion for Bethany Lutheran Primary School ran outside, while other sessions run in halls or classrooms. These active, cultural and engaging incursions also give students a positive way to spend their holidays: they keep children moving, build confidence and connect them with new friends through music and dance.

