## Vacation care incursion details at a glance

- **Ages:** School-aged children, 5 years and up
- **Duration:** 30 minutes to 1.5 hours, depending on group size, ages and activity
- **Group size:** Several sessions of around 30 children, or one large session together
- **Instruments:** Real African drums and percussion, all supplied
- **Programs:** Five vacation care incursions to choose from
- **Discounts:** Package discount when you book multiple incursions

So whether you have a small group or a full holiday program, we’ll tailor the session to suit your children and your space.
{% /column %}

