## How to book vacation care incursions

1. **Choose your dates:** First, tell us your holiday dates, location and the number of children.
2. **Pick your programs:** Then choose from our five incursions, or book several for a package discount.
3. **We plan the session:** After that, we confirm session times, group sizes and your space.
4. **Drum Sing Dance!:** Finally, we arrive with all the drums, so you just bring the children.
{% /section %}

{% section tone="grey" %}
## Vacation care incursions FAQs

{% faq %}
{% question title="What ages are your vacation care incursions for?" %}
Our vacation care incursions are designed for school-aged children from 5 years old. In addition, we adapt activities to suit mixed ages and abilities.
{% /question %}

{% question title="How long does a session run?" %}
Sessions run from 30 minutes to 1.5 hours, depending on group size, ages and activity. So let us know your program and we’ll suggest the best timing.
{% /question %}

{% question title="How many children can take part?" %}
We can run several sessions with around 30 children in each. Otherwise, we can run one large session with everyone together.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do we need to supply drums?" %}
No. We bring real African drums and percussion, so every child plays at no extra cost.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do you offer discounts?" %}
Yes. There are five different vacation care incursions to choose from, and multiple bookings receive a package discount.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Which areas do you visit?" %}
We visit OSHC and vacation care services on the Sunshine Coast and in Brisbane, as well as across Australia. What’s more, there are no travel fees.
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}
{% /section %}

